# Copilot Credits Dashboard - Force Auth0 session cookie refresh

## When to use?

Use when a user needs to reauthenticate their access to [Check My Copilot AI Credits Usage](https://moj-copilot-ai-credits-dashboard-prod.cloud-platform.service.justice.gov.uk/).

This may be as a result of changes in user persmissions or changes to the application.

## How to refresh the session cookie

Step 1: Click on `View Site Information` i.e. the just to the left of the browser address bar

Step 2: Click on `Cookies and site data`

Step 3: Click on `Manage on-device site data`

Step 4: Click on the bin icon next to `moj-copilot-ai-credits-dashboard-prod.cloud-platform.service.justice.gov.uk` to delete the cookie

Step 5:  Click `Done` and then refresh you page to reauthenticate and access the dashboard
